    "This permanently replaces all current data with the contents of the selected backup. This cannot be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Выбранная резервная копия безвозвратно заменит все текущие данные."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This will add sample accounts, transactions, budgets and scheduled items. Your existing data will not be affected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Будут добавлены демонстрационные счета, операции, бюджеты и регулярные платежи. Ваши данные сохранятся."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This will permanently delete all accounts, transactions, budgets, rules, and categories. This cannot be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
